  "description": "Proposed single-storey rear extension (Retrospective)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div&gt;The existing single storey rear extension, by reason of its excessive total rearward projection, is unduly obtrusive, results in overshadowing and loss of outlook, and would be detrimental to the visual and residential amenities of the occupiers of the adjacent properties, No 21 Warden Avenue, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3.D 7 of The London Plan (2021), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/div&gt;"
